  "description": "\"I'll take you to the ocean.\" \n\nOne day, Hae-Dal, who lives on an ivory island, meets an injured mermaid, Iro, on the beach. Iro is being chased by mysterious people, and it's not easy for him to carry his injured body back to the sea. Will Hae-Dal be able to protect him, and will they be able to stay together? \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
